    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423140/extras/a4470338c93d0c3422a5c2f26ac6d060.avif?t=1695737948\" /></span><br><br>Play as Albert Longtooth, proud son of the mysteriously disappeared inventors Dr. &amp; Dr. Longtooth. They have left you with a fully functional laboratory and an almost finished mind controlling technology. Lead a revolution by transforming regular citizens into fearless brain chipped warriors!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423140/extras/9bf23837b881333b0a0b7d1a15816fe1.avif?t=1695737948\" /></span><br><br>Have you ever tried to craft brain chips to control a bunch of minions? It\u2019s hard \u2026 like really hard! A good mad scientist knows that science needs trials and errors. Your chips may have some slight defects, like burning your minions, or making them explode. But you\u2019ll get better as you practice. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423140/extras/0c32913e224ded715795c95b99f54710.avif?t=1695737948\" /></span><br><br>As you watch your team fight, trigger their chips at the right moment for maximum efficiency! Is Clyde surrounded by enemies? Time for a deadly spin attack. Are all the enemies on the same line? Time for Frank\u2019s ultra-beam!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423140/extras/a4470338c93d0c3422a5c2f26ac6d060.avif?t=1695737948\" /></span><br><br>Play as Albert Longtooth, proud son of the mysteriously disappeared inventors Dr. &amp; Dr. Longtooth. They have left you with a fully functional laboratory and an almost finished mind controlling technology. Lead a revolution by transforming regular citizens into fearless brain chipped warriors!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423140/extras/9bf23837b881333b0a0b7d1a15816fe1.avif?t=1695737948\" /></span><br><br>Have you ever tried to craft brain chips to control a bunch of minions? It\u2019s hard \u2026 like really hard! A good mad scientist knows that science needs trials and errors. Your chips may have some slight defects, like burning your minions, or making them explode. But you\u2019ll get better as you practice. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423140/extras/0c32913e224ded715795c95b99f54710.avif?t=1695737948\" /></span><br><br>As you watch your team fight, trigger their chips at the right moment for maximum efficiency! Is Clyde surrounded by enemies? Time for a deadly spin attack. Are all the enemies on the same line? Time for Frank\u2019s ultra-beam!",
